No, those are still not all the attacks. The cyber threat landscape features hundreds of distinct, specialized attack methodologies targeting every layer of technology—from hardware chips and cloud networks to the human brain itself. [1, 2, 3] 
Vulnerabilities mutate constantly as new technologies like Artificial Intelligence, blockchain, and microservices emerge. [4, 5] 
